Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.88,0:04:23.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.20,0:00:28.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.01,0:00:30.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.09,0:00:32.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.19,0:01:11.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.17,0:01:17.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实...\N{\fnArial\fs30}So...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.49,0:01:23.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那谷仓里全是行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}The barn is full of walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.05,0:02:08.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可别告诉我这没什么大不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot tell me you're all right with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.07,0:02:09.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然不是  但我们是客\N{\fnArial\fs30}No I'm not, but we're guests here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.47,0:02:10.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里不是我们的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't our land.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.50,0:02:12.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-但命是我们自己的  -小声点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This is our lives! - Lower your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:14.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能就这么算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't just sweep this under the rug.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.93,0:02:17.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这肯定不行  绝对不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't right. Not remotely.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.47,0:02:20.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们要么冲进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we've either got to go in there,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.06,0:02:22.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把他们搞定  要么掉脸走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to make things right or we've just got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:24.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去本宁堡的路线我们已经讨论够久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we have been talking about Fort Benning for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.28,0:02:25.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.19,0:02:26.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么  瑞克  为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why, rick? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.43,0:02:28.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我女儿还没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because my daughter is still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.28,0:02:29.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.23,0:02:33.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得现在我们也该\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I think it's time that we all start to just
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.82,0:02:34.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-考虑下另一种可能了吧  -肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}-consider the other possibility.  - Shane
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.98,0:02:37.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能扔下索菲亚不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not leaving Sophia behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.06,0:02:38.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我差一点就找到那孩子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm close to finding this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.24,0:02:39.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,两天前我还找到了她的娃娃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just found her damn doll two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.78,0:02:40.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你找到了她的娃娃  达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found her doll, Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.93,0:02:42.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可不是嘛  只个娃娃而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you did. You found a doll.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.47,0:02:44.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你他妈根本不知道自己在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what the hell you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.66,0:02:46.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是说句实话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying what needs to be said.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.21,0:02:47.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有在失踪前48小时找到的线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get a good lead,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.35,0:02:48.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,才能算得上好线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's in the first 48 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.37,0:02:49.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩  别说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane, stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.19,0:02:50.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我跟你直说了吧  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you something else, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.71,0:02:51.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就算她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she was alive out there
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.91,0:02:54.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到你疯疯癫癫地走过来  手拿猎刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}and saw you coming all methed out with your buck knife
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.88,0:02:56.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脖子上还挂了串僵尸耳朵\N{\fnArial\fs30}and geek ears around your neck,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.11,0:02:58.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她也会被吓得朝另一个方向跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}she would run in the other direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:07.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-后退  -别碰我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Back off! - Keep your hands off me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.87,0:03:10.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我跟赫谢尔谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now just let me talk to hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:12.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-让我来解决  -你要怎么解决\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me figure it out. - What are you gonna figure out?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.91,0:03:15.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们想留下来 想清掉这个谷仓\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're gonna stay, if we're gonna clear this barn,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.11,0:03:17.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得先说服他  这是他的地盘\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to talk him into it. This is his land.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.86,0:03:21.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫谢尔把这些行尸看作人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel sees those things in there as people--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.96,0:03:23.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sick people--
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.62,0:03:26.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他的妻子  他的继子\N{\fnArial\fs30}his wife, his stepson.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.00,0:03:26.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道这事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.98,0:03:28.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我昨天刚跟赫谢尔谈过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday I talked to Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.76,0:03:29.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你还瞒了我们一晚上\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you waited the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.81,0:03:32.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得我们还能安全地过上一晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought we could survive one more night.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.15,0:03:33.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.30,0:03:35.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我本想今早再说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was waiting till this morning to say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.98,0:03:37.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但格伦想亲自告诉大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}But glenn wanted to be the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.04,0:03:38.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那人是个疯子  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man is crazy, rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.20,0:03:39.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果赫谢尔认为那些行尸还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}If hershel thinks those things are alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.78,0:03:40.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.91,0:05:18.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.03,0:05:22.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬  别不理我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, maggie, just talk to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.35,0:05:30.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.86,0:05:32.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.47,0:05:36.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把帽子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.57,0:05:38.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说想谈谈  那就谈呐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said talk to you, I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.81,0:05:39.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把帽子给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.44,0:05:52.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你干嘛要这样浪费鸡蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would you waste an egg like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.20,0:05:53.78,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我觉得这鸡蛋坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think it was rotten.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.72,0:06:11.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩觉得索菲亚死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does shane think sophia's dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:17.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他只是害怕了而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane's just scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.19,0:06:20.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怕谷仓里的行尸?  -是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- of the walkers in the barn? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.22,0:06:26.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mom,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.85,0:06:30.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在找到索菲亚之前  我是不会走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not leaving until we find sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.44,0:06:35.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且  找到之后我也不想离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't want to go even after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.46,0:06:39.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会离开的  卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we're not leaving, carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.90,0:06:42.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把作业写完吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You finish those problems.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:47.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just think...she...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.32,0:06:50.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她会喜欢这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's gonna like it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:54.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里  这里就像家一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place, it could be a home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.68,0:07:25.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你不能这样  -我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can't. - I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.76,0:07:27.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫谢尔说你需要多休息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel said you need to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.88,0:07:29.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.63,0:07:31.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.22,0:07:35.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克待会要出去接着找\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick's going out later to follow the trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.17,0:07:39.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是吗  我也不会袖手旁观的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah well, I ain't gonna sit around and do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.09,0:07:42.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  你去会伤得更重\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you're gonna go out there and get yourself hurt even worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.14,0:07:48.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道还能不能找到她  达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know if we're gonna find her, daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.81,0:07:50.97,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.70,0:07:57.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.94,0:08:05.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.01,0:08:08.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不能再失去你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't lose you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.19,0:08:26.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你没事吧  -别管我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you all right? - Just leave me be.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.46,0:08:30.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蠢女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.73,0:08:41.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安德莉亚在找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea's looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.26,0:08:43.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.29,0:08:46.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能再找顶帽子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any chance you got an extra hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.55,0:08:48.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找不到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nope.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.84,0:08:53.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.66,0:08:58.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要跟瑞克一起去找索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Going off with Rick to look for Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.58,0:09:04.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为他在跟赫谢尔谈呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he was talking with Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.16,0:09:06.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他去谈了  我们准备等他谈完了再去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He is. We're gonna go after.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.16,0:09:07.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我现在要去谷仓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm headed to the barn in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.40,0:09:10.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩说要个人在那守着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane wants a watch duty down there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.93,0:09:12.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.74,0:09:14.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why wouldn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.19,0:09:17.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你只拿你的枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you only getting yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.98,0:09:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道你和他之间发生什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know what's going on with you and him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.66,0:09:25.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谁  -肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Him? - Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.02,0:09:27.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-戴尔  -这不关我事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dale. - It's not my business.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.51,0:09:29.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是担心你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}All that matters to me is that you--
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.86,0:09:33.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也许并不了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may not really know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.79,0:09:36.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们之间不需要这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't need to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.11,0:09:38.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你跟我终于...  -这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You and I are finally-- - it's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.39,0:09:40.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道  你不喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it. You don't like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.53,0:09:43.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不是这样  -那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It isn't that. - Then what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.65,0:09:48.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想那么过日子吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that how you want to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.17,0:09:50.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像他那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like him?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.51,0:09:55.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不是受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not a victim.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.82,0:10:00.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不了解他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.77,0:10:07.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔  我希望你别再这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale, I need you to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.96,0:10:09.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你花这么多精力\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spend so much time
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.50,0:10:11.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,照顾我  守着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Watching me, looking out for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.12,0:10:14.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只要一关心你  你就开始训我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to beat me up anytime I show any concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.35,0:10:18.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你走吧  我不说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go ahead. I'm done.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.31,0:10:20.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不是要训你  戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not beating you up, Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.78,0:10:23.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没事  真的  情况已经...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay, really. Things are...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.84,0:10:26.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不同了\N{\fnArial\fs30}different.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.98,0:10:31.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看你该出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got your gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.36,0:10:36.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.16,0:10:49.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你还好吧  -没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.49,0:10:55.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,跑一趟帮我拿点水来行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mind running and getting me some water?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.12,0:10:57.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just--
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.37,0:10:59.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想休息会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.32,0:11:01.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你接着守吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll keep watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.47,0:11:07.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.23,0:11:10.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.67,0:11:32.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on in.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.18,0:11:51.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吃饭还看书啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little light reading for lunch?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.38,0:11:54.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我最近很努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been working so hard lately
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.65,0:11:57.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论在哪都要接着研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get my studying where I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.83,0:12:00.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我们可以帮你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know we can help you out with your work.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.27,0:12:02.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这属于我研究的范畴\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my field to tend.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.92,0:12:09.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们知道了谷仓的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found the barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.14,0:12:12.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别管它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it be.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:14.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想和你谈谈这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'd like to talk about it,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.34,0:12:14.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过\N{\fnArial\fs30}but either way--
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.95,0:12:17.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论是谷仓还是农场还是你说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}your barn, your farm, your say.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.85,0:12:19.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想和你谈谷仓的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to talk about the barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.60,0:12:20.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想和你争论\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to debate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.76,0:12:23.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是争论  是讨论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a debate, a discussion.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.47,0:12:37.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和你的人周末之前得离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you and your group gone by the end of the week.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.69,0:12:44.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和戴尔谈过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I talked to Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.90,0:12:47.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在行尸的问题上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I have our differences
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.73,0:12:49.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们看法不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the way we look at the walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.30,0:12:53.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those people,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.28,0:12:56.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也许已经死了  也许还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}they may be dead, they may be alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.64,0:12:58.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But my people, us,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.13,0:13:01.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}we are alive right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.04,0:13:03.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就在这  就在你眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}right here, right in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.70,0:13:05.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要是逼我们离开  有些人可能就活不成了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You send us out there and that could change.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.44,0:13:07.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我给你们提供了避风港\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've given you safe harbor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.90,0:13:09.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我对得起自己的良心\N{\fnArial\fs30}My conscience is clear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.68,0:13:15.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}This farm--
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.77,0:13:17.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个农场很特殊\N{\fnArial\fs30}this farm is special.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:21.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们早已与世隔绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been shielded from what's been going on out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.18,0:13:24.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔说你在新闻上看到了发生的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale said you saw everything happen on the news.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.35,0:13:29.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但新闻已经很久没播了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's been-- it's been a long time since the cameras stopped rolling.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.48,0:13:33.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我第一次见到行尸的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}The first time I saw a walker,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.67,0:13:36.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它只有半个身子  想要咬我\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was just half a body snapping at me from the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.16,0:13:38.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不想杀它\N{\fnArial\fs30}My inclination wasn't to kill it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.74,0:13:40.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在外面的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what the world is out there
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.05,0:13:41.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和你在电视上看到的不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't what you saw on TV.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.79,0:13:45.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,变得非常糟糕  足以改变一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is much much worse and it changes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.90,0:13:46.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是变成行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either into one of them
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.82,0:13:50.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还是变得比以前野蛮\N{\fnArial\fs30}or something a lot less than the person you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.05,0:13:53.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,请不要逼我们离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please do not-- do not send us out there again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.57,0:14:07.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我妻子怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My wife's pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.95,0:14:13.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这里  这是件高兴的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's either a gift here
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.69,0:14:15.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一出去  就是必死无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}or a death sentence out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.27,0:14:21.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你让我们留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we were to stay we could help you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.35,0:14:23.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以帮你干活  保卫这个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}with the work, with securing this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.31,0:14:24.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以一起活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can survive together.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.64,0:14:27.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  我说了不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, I'm telling you we can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.26,0:14:29.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你想想自己在做什么  -我想过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think about what you're doing. - I've thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.51,0:14:31.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-仔细想想  -我想过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Think about it. - I've thought about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.11,0:14:33.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就再仔细想想  我们不能离开这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it again. We can't go out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.53,0:15:24.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么样  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it gonna be, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.01,0:15:27.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们留还是走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which way does this thing go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.54,0:15:28.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.06,0:15:31.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what did he say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.52,0:15:34.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们还在商量  -你们商...\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We're negotiating. - You're nego--
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.32,0:15:37.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时间紧迫  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Clock's ticking, Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.49,0:15:39.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的  肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No it isn't, Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.34,0:15:41.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谷仓很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}That barn-- the barn is secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.38,0:15:43.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不是听他说  我们根本发现发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't even know about it till this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.22,0:15:45.74,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们是没发现  但是现在知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't. Well, we know about it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.06,0:15:48.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们现在知道那里面有一群行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right? We know there's over a dozen walkers in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.32,0:15:51.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谷仓离我们的营地只有一步之遥\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know that it's about a stone's throw
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.04,0:15:53.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就睡在谷仓周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}from our camp, Rick-- where we sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.28,0:15:55.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以  如果不进去把它们杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So look, if we're not gonna go
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.19,0:15:57.12,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们还是赶紧离开为好\N{\fnArial\fs30}in there and clear it out then we just got to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.12,0:15:59.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能杀死它们  也不能离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna clear it out and we're not gonna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.01,0:15:59.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们至少得配枪防身\N{\fnArial\fs30}We at least need our guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.83,0:16:02.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能用枪  在这不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't have them, not here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.25,0:16:04.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方这么不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you want to stay here
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.40,0:16:05.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么还要留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it's not safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.23,0:16:07.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以让这变安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can make it safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.10,0:16:09.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-怎么做  -我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How we gonna do that? - We will, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.60,0:16:10.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么能让这个地方变安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}How we gonna make it safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.33,0:16:11.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会的  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.05,0:16:12.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  老兄  这不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man, it's not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.47,0:16:14.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩  洛莉怀孕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane, Lori's pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.17,0:16:23.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.55,0:16:25.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need our guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.25,0:16:28.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不需要  我会处理好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I can work this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.65,0:16:34.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你没事吧  -没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You good? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.19,0:16:38.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛莉有小宝宝了  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori's having a baby, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.70,0:16:41.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恭喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.79,0:16:46.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.13,0:17:04.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗨  亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.97,0:17:22.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔不需要我的照看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl doesn't need any more of my help.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.57,0:17:23.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是这样了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.58,0:17:29.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克想要说服我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick was trying to make his case.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.49,0:17:33.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然离开这后会很难  要时刻小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It'll be hard. They'll have to be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.49,0:17:34.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他的表现一直让人印象深刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he was being dramatic.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.99,0:17:38.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是强有力的队伍  一路上做得都很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're a strong group. They've done well on their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.18,0:17:41.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们只是要离开这  去寻找自己的农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're just gonna have to go out and find their own farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.53,0:17:44.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在外面有大把的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's plenty of them now to chose from.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.20,0:17:46.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有的  这些农场不是被烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There aren't. Every one of them nearby
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.38,0:17:48.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是挤满了行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}is burned out or full of walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.62,0:17:51.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Walkers?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.06,0:17:57.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那难道我们让这些人永远留在这吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we just keep these people here forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.38,0:18:01.18,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要如何承担责任\N{\fnArial\fs30}How are they my responsibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.59,0:18:04.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你个建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}A new command I give to you:
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.44,0:18:09.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,像我爱你那样  去爱别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love one another as I have loved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.04,0:18:12.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是你告诉我的  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what you told me, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.95,0:18:18.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我曾经很生继母的气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was mad about mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.36,0:18:22.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,气你娶了安妮特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mad about you marrying Annette.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.00,0:18:26.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只有14岁  对你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was 14 years old and I was awful,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.14,0:18:28.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比对别人更糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}to you more than anybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.09,0:18:32.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想吸烟  偷商店里的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I wanted to do was smoke and shoplift.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.98,0:18:36.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去爱别人  你当时告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love one another. That's what you told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.57,0:18:39.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.93,0:18:42.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was different.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.64,0:18:44.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.78,0:18:46.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're different.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.28,0:18:48.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是不一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.86,0:18:51.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我们没有变\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.14,0:18:54.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.87,0:18:56.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一点没有变\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.17,0:19:01.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为那个亚裔男孩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this about you and the Asian boy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.20,0:19:02.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你想让我  -不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you want me to-- - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.25,0:19:08.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他叫格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}His name is Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.95,0:19:12.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天有一个你认为病了的人想要杀死我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He saved my life yesterday when one of the people
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.08,0:19:14.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you think is sick tried to kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.75,0:19:16.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事够印象深刻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that for dramatic?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.10,0:19:21.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事情不是你想象的那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things aren't what you think they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.83,0:19:23.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They aren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.10,0:19:25.62,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要赶他们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.56,0:19:29.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  不是因为我和格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? It's not about me and Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.24,0:19:31.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不是因为我和你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not about me and you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.33,0:19:33.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这全在于你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:35.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这关乎到你是一个什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about who you are,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.36,0:19:37.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要成为什么样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}who you're gonna be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.01,0:19:39.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.03,0:19:44.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,又出现了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happened again.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.77,0:19:50.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她可能往南走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}...Also shows she could be moving this way south.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.64,0:19:52.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果索菲亚一直顺着那个方向\N{\fnArial\fs30}If Sophia kept in that direction,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.32,0:19:55.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她很可能已经走出森林  进入农田了\N{\fnArial\fs30}she might have gotten out of the forest and into the farmland.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.26,0:19:57.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们走74号公路去常春藤路\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we take 74 up to Ivy road,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.44,0:19:58.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后下车步行往南\N{\fnArial\fs30}then push down south on foot
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.81,0:20:01.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,穿过森林  一直走到克里斯多夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}through the forest till we hit Christopher,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.48,0:20:03.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,向东走几里  然后原路返回\N{\fnArial\fs30}go east a couple of miles and then double back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.95,0:20:06.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-瑞克  -赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick. - Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.23,0:20:09.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们需要带上枪去找索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just have our guns out because we're gonna go look for Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.10,0:20:12.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在此之前  你可以帮我个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before you do that, I could use your help with something.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.06,0:20:13.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算我一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Count me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.42,0:20:16.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  但是我只需要瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, but I just need Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.69,0:20:22.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去谷仓那边看着  好了来找我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be down at the barn keeping watch until you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.44,0:20:59.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我以为他死了  -肖恩  我不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I thought he was dead. - Shane, I don't--
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.76,0:21:03.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他回来的时候  就在那一刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then when he came back, right then, right there,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.16,0:21:05.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我希望他真的已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you see I wished he was.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.94,0:21:08.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是因为你不再属于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not-- not because you wouldn't be mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.84,0:21:12.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而是因为我知道早晚他都会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}but because I knew that sooner or later he would be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.35,0:21:18.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}See Rick,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.26,0:21:21.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他不适合这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}he ain't built for this world,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.54,0:21:23.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不适合现在这样的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}not for what it is now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.66,0:21:26.68,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你错了  你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong. You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.68,0:21:28.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,洛莉  他救过你几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lori, how many times has he saved your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.63,0:21:32.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想知道有几次  因为据我计算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just-- I want to know how many times. Because by my count,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.10,0:21:34.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在不同的情境下救过你四次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've saved your life on four different occasions.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.15,0:21:35.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,同时也算救了卡尔四次\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's Carl's too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.13,0:21:36.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我只想问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I just want to ask you,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.09,0:21:37.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克救过你几次\N{\fnArial\fs30}how many times has Rick saved your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.47,0:21:38.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在营地的那晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}That night at the camp.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.43,0:21:39.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在营地  吃完烤鱼的那次\N{\fnArial\fs30}That night at the camp after the fish fry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.51,0:21:42.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不不不  你看  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No no no. See, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.02,0:21:44.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那次也是我救了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was me too.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.93,0:21:47.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克来晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, Rick, he showed up late
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.90,0:21:51.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他去做一件无意义  相当于自杀的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he went on a suicide mission over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.69,0:21:54.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  他去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he joined in,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.34,0:21:56.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果他没有为了救一个毒贩\N{\fnArial\fs30}but see, we wouldn't have been in that situation
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.15,0:21:58.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而丢下我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he hadn't left because he felt
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.40,0:22:01.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就不会遭遇那种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he needed to leave to save a drug dealer.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.60,0:22:03.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们失去了艾米  小吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so we lost Amy and we lost Jim.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.89,0:22:05.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还失去了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}We lost--
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.92,0:22:14.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克跟我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.21,0:22:16.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.10,0:22:19.34,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你为什么不告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know the reason why you didn't
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.92,0:22:21.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你知道孩子是我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}is because you know it's mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.51,0:22:23.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-是瑞克的  -好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's Rick's. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.24,0:22:25.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克回来之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we carried on quite a bit
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.10,0:22:28.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们好过一阵  洛莉  孩子是我的  你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}before rick got back, lori. It's mine. You know it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.55,0:22:30.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是  你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong. You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.19,0:22:34.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起  肖恩  对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. Shane, I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.44,0:22:36.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,即便孩子是你的  也不会喊你爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even if it's yours, it's not gonna be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.37,0:22:37.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's never gonne be yours
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.83,0:22:40.60,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做什么都无法改变这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}and there's nothing you can do to change that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.39,0:22:48.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我用不着改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.79,0:23:12.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等下  肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.07,0:23:14.53,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能和你谈谈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I talk to you for a sec?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.10,0:23:23.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.67,0:23:25.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.65,0:23:27.22,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道你认为索菲亚已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you think Sophia's dead
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.22,0:23:29.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用再继续找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that we should stop looking for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.78,0:23:32.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-可那纯属是放屁  -小伙子  注意用词\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But that's bullshit. - Hey, man, watch your mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.52,0:23:34.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到她之前  我们得一直留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna stay here until we find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.62,0:23:39.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得我们该这么办吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that's what we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.76,0:23:41.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,据我所知  就得这么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what I know we should do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.40,0:23:45.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那我们就留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.16,0:23:48.94,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样的话  我们就得\N{\fnArial\fs30}That means we got to do
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.57,0:23:52.11,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想尽一切办法留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}whatever we got to do to make that happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.11,0:23:54.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如帮忙做杂活吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like help out with chores?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.37,0:24:04.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比如帮忙做杂活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like help out with the chores.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.30,0:24:06.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.70,0:24:08.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here for a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.98,0:24:11.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不你去看看能不能给你妈搭把手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you go see what your mom wants?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.53,0:24:14.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗  快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm? Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.31,0:24:17.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.35,0:24:21.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别再让我听到你出言不逊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let me hear you talk like that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.89,0:24:34.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.81,0:25:01.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他娘的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.74,0:25:08.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看到他去哪里了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see where he went?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.26,0:25:11.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谁  -别跟我来这套  行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who? - Don't even try to shit me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.91,0:25:13.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么意思  -戴尔  格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Dale, Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.52,0:25:15.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到戴尔去哪里了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see where Dale went?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.67,0:25:17.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了  他让我跑去给他拿些水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he asked me to run and get him some water.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.79,0:25:19.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他说会帮我放会哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he'd cover me on watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.46,0:25:21.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后你回来的时候他就不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he was gone when you got back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.90,0:25:23.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.68,0:25:25.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他不会有事吧  -不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You think he's okay? - Oh, he's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.11,0:25:26.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那他为什么还玩下声东击西?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd he bail then?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.95,0:25:29.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样你就没法给我指出他跑的方向了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you wouldn't tell me which way he went.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.76,0:25:30.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.62,0:25:34.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  伙计  你不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.48,0:25:42.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,底部的裂缝就像胶一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}The silt on the bottom is like glue.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.52,0:25:44.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会沉下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just sink in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.25,0:25:47.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就是露·布什\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Lou Bush.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.03,0:25:49.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew him?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.32,0:25:51.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"露"是"露易丝"的简称\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lou as in louise.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.73,0:25:54.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她在路头那有家农场\N{\fnArial\fs30}She has a farm up the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.39,0:25:55.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,种的大多是甜玉米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet corn mostly.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.76,0:25:58.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,周末在哈普曼的酒吧打工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worked at Hapman's bar on weekends.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.40,0:26:01.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不认识那个男的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man, I don't know him,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.57,0:26:03.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我认得那身工作服\N{\fnArial\fs30}but the coveralls,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.73,0:26:05.48,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去过他工作的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been to where he worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.11,0:26:07.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你杀死过多少个\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many have you killed?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.33,0:26:09.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,数不胜数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too many to count.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.37,0:26:13.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能收手吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.43,0:26:21.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面的那些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are people out there
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.84,0:26:24.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大脑不受自己支配\N{\fnArial\fs30}who haven't been in their right minds,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.55,0:26:27.20,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我相信他们能恢复正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}people who I believe can be restored.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.20,0:26:30.30,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你谈论的不是行尸  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not talking about the walkers, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.49,0:26:34.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是否把他们当人看不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't matter if you see them as human beings anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.07,0:26:36.65,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可如果你和你的人想留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you and your people are going to stay here,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.65,0:26:38.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们就得把他们当人看待\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's how you're gonna have to treat them.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.99,0:26:42.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我的农场  我的谷仓  我说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}My farm, my barn, my say.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.43,0:26:54.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-看见没  -看见什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You see it? - See what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.38,0:27:04.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.77,0:27:17.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天早上的事  我感到很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm sorry about what happened this morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.92,0:27:20.67,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你当时只是要去找她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted to look for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.22,0:27:24.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.63,0:27:28.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直想问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}This whole time I've wanted to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.32,0:27:32.44,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我觉得她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I think she's still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.90,0:27:42.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,事实是  我还能做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Truth is, what else I got to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.10,0:28:02.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们会找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.56,0:28:03.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.94,0:28:07.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有预感\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.26,0:28:17.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥蒂斯说如果你能拉着他们走一半路程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otis said if you get them halfway out
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.48,0:28:18.64,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剩下靠他们自己就能走完\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'll do the rest of the work.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.64,0:28:20.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他做过多少次\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many times did he do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.50,0:28:22.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一有晃悠到农场的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If one wandered onto the property,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.24,0:28:24.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,奥蒂斯就会把他们弄进谷仓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otis would get them into the barn.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.75,0:28:26.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们得干这活了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.06,0:28:28.19,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谷仓要是满了怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happens when the barn gets full?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.28,0:28:30.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-天哪  -抓住杆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jeez! - Get the pole!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.62,0:28:33.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉米  吉米  瑞克你抓住它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy. Jimmy. You got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.29,0:28:35.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慢点  慢点  引着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Easy. Easy, Rick. Lead him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.49,0:28:37.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吉米会帮我们看着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jimmy will spot for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.04,0:28:39.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,往前引  瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lead him lead him, rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.57,0:28:41.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,诱饵是你  不是手里的杆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're the carrot, not the stick.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.24,0:28:43.85,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按我说的做  诱导着他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me, just lead him.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.85,0:28:45.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他就会跟你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.16,0:28:48.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说奥蒂斯做起来很容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me he handled them easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.64,0:28:50.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这还叫容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.87,0:28:52.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,比有些事容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's easier than some things.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.56,0:28:56.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来  走这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on, over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.86,0:29:11.24,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.87,0:29:15.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.58,0:29:22.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.87,0:29:25.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.68,0:29:27.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬  等一下下就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie, just stop for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.28,0:29:30.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你问我这件事  你告诉戴尔  这都成\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talked about it. You told Dale, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.17,0:29:33.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我让你别说出去  我告诉过你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I asked you. I told you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.13,0:29:35.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就求过你这一件事  一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just asked you for one thing. One thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.09,0:29:36.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.51,0:29:38.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸现在要把你们赶走  他跟我说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad's gonna kick you guys out now. He told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.52,0:29:40.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  瑞克会想办法说服你爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Rick's gonna work something out with your dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.41,0:29:43.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我必须告诉他们  -你根本没必要说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? I had to tell them. - You did not.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.03,0:29:44.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  我必须说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.98,0:29:47.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我自己想说出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.73,0:29:52.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听我说  我忘记了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, you see I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.21,0:29:54.40,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我忘了  或者也是没多想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? I forgot or I stopped thinking about it
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.40,0:29:56.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我不愿意想这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or maybe I didn't want to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.76,0:29:59.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让他们把我吊进井里  觉得好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I let them lower me into that well like it was fun,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.37,0:30:00.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像我在玩"传送门"\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like I was playing "Portal."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.68,0:30:03.52,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这是个游戏  -当然是游戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's a video game. - Of course it's a video game.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.52,0:30:04.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是昨天在药房发生的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then the pharmacy
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.05,0:30:06.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我清醒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}happened yesterday and I realized something.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:06.71,0:30:08.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我忘了他们很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I forgot that they're dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.94,0:30:10.86,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不管他们是病人还是死人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't care if they're sick people or dead people,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.87,0:30:12.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,反正他们很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.76,0:30:14.28,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,而且我还意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I realized something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.90,0:30:17.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不想你再有任何危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}That I don't want you in danger ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.53,0:30:20.09,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我痛恨曝出你爸爸的秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I hate to blow your dad's big secret,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.09,0:30:21.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我讨厌保密\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm sick of secrets.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.98,0:30:23.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,秘密会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Secrets get you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:23.86,0:30:26.26,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我宁愿你活着恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'd rather have you pissed off at me and alive
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.27,0:30:27.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也不想你死了爱我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Than liking me and dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.33,0:30:29.66,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是我告诉他们的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's why I told them.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.26,0:30:34.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂  僵尸诱饵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, walker bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.02,0:30:36.15,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这么叫我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't call me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.14,0:30:42.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Glenn.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.18,0:31:17.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老头  这可真是个藏东西的好地方啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, this is a good hiding place.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.50,0:31:20.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱还没怎么来过沼泽  对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't been in the swamps much, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.07,0:31:26.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么就不利用你的追踪技巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine if you applied your tracking skills
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.61,0:31:28.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去找索菲亚呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}To finding Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.41,0:31:30.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.76,0:31:33.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把那袋子给我  如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just give me that bag, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.77,0:31:36.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不会这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.96,0:31:38.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会给我的  戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah you are, Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.12,0:31:40.06,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unless, well,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.70,0:31:44.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能先一枪把我撂倒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do have that rifle over your shoulder.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.61,0:31:46.73,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想像对付奥蒂斯一样杀掉我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gonna shoot me like you did Otis?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.18,0:31:48.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再编个故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell another story?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.81,0:31:50.82,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.50,0:31:54.21,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实在阴暗的光线下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, when you really look at it
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.68,0:31:56.04,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么看过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the cold light of day,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.60,0:31:59.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你已经跟死人差不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're pretty much dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.84,0:32:05.29,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把枪给我吧  快点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just give me the guns. Do it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.33,0:32:08.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得这样就能保证大家安全吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think this is gonna keep us safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.09,0:32:10.46,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  我知道能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mm-hmm. I know it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.69,0:32:13.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克正在和赫谢尔谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick is trying to get Hershel--
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.59,0:32:17.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,戴尔  闭嘴  别说了  把枪给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dale, shut up. Just shut up and give me the guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.69,0:32:31.00,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你非要我一枪毙了你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I gonna have to shoot you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.64,0:32:34.55,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非要我杀了你吗  只有这么做才行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I have to kill you? Is that what it's gonna take?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.58,0:32:52.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.62,0:32:55.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有这么做才行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what it's gonna take.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.05,0:33:07.79,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩  你属于这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where you belong, Shane.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.79,0:33:09.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么说  戴尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's that, Dale?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.07,0:33:11.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个世界  如今的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This world, what it is now,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.22,0:33:14.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这人就属于这世道\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.87,0:33:20.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许我没你这种生存的本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I may not have what it takes to last for long,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.27,0:33:22.03,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不过我无所谓\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.73,0:33:25.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为至少我可以凭良心说\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause at least I can say
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.74,0:33:28.93,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在这个世界陷入深渊时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the world goes to shit
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.93,0:33:31.14,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有和它一起堕落\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't let it take me down with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.39,0:33:36.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,说得好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fair enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.85,0:33:48.50,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看起来都该去排队买特价早餐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like you should be in line for the early bird special.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.01,0:33:52.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把你帽子拿来  我帮你洗洗  好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go get your cap. I'll wash it for you, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.51,0:33:55.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们知道出什么事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.84,0:33:58.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-大伙去哪儿了  -你们没看见瑞克吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is everyone? - You haven't seen Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.16,0:33:58.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他跟赫谢尔出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He went off with Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.99,0:34:00.76,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们几小时前就该出发了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were supposed to leave a couple hours ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.76,0:34:02.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是啊  搞什么鬼啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah you were. What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.88,0:34:04.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克跟我们说他要出去一会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick told us he was going out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.15,0:34:08.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞毛啊  你们当这是开玩笑的对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it. Isn't anybody taking this seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.65,0:34:10.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们又不是没线索\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got us a damn trail.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.41,0:34:12.71,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.47,0:34:20.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-这是什么  -你挺我吗  老弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What's all this? - You with me, man?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.49,0:34:23.31,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了  该像个大人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Time to grow up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.73,0:34:26.61,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你拿好枪了吧  -拿好了  戴尔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You already got yours? - Yeah. Where's Dale?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.61,0:34:28.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他就来  -我以为咱们不能拿枪呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's on his way. - Thought we couldn't carry.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.23,0:34:29.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能  而且必须这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can and we have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.23,0:34:32.42,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在我们认为这儿应该是个安全的地方时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it was one thing sitting around here picking daisies
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.42,0:34:34.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坐下来摘个菊花啥的倒没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we thought this place was supposed to be safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.41,0:34:35.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可我们现在知道这儿不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now we know it ain't.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.70,0:34:39.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来吗  老弟  你要保护你女人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about you, man? You gonna protect yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.32,0:34:42.84,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就对了  你能开枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it. Can you shoot?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.84,0:34:44.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你能消停会儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you stop?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.09,0:34:45.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把枪发给大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do this, you hand out these guns,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.05,0:34:46.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我爸今晚就会赶你们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}my dad will make you leave tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.70,0:34:48.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-肖恩  我们必须留下  -这是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to stay, Shane. - What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.51,0:34:50.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们哪儿也不去  懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We ain't going anywhere, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.07,0:34:53.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听好了  赫谢尔  他要明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now look, Hershel, he's just gotta understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.13,0:34:55.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,懂吗  他必须明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay? He-- well, he's gonna have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.36,0:34:57.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们得找到索菲亚  我说的对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we need to find Sophia. Am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.94,0:35:00.25,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对吧  现在我要你拿好这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh? Now I want you to take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.25,0:35:02.16,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿好了  卡尔  你要保护妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take it, Carl, and you keep your mother safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.16,0:35:02.90,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.90,0:35:04.69,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你明白怎么做  拿好枪  然后动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how. Go on, take the gun and do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.69,0:35:06.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克说了不许拿枪  这轮不到你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick said no guns. This is not your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.73,0:35:09.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事不由你说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not your decision to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.05,0:35:10.35,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.18,0:35:18.41,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.40,0:35:21.63,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-搞什么啊  -肖恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is that? - Shane!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.77,0:35:32.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们这是搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.07,0:35:34.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-肖恩  退后  -你的人怎么都拿起枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shane, just back off. - Why do your people have guns?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.87,0:35:36.88,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们开什么玩笑  看见没\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you kidding me? You see?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.89,0:35:38.57,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你看见他们抓的玩意了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see what they're holding onto?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.57,0:35:41.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我知道我抓的是谁  -没  老头  你不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I see who I'm holding onto. - No, man, you don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.01,0:35:42.91,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩  让我们处理吧  待会儿再谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane, just let us do this and then we can talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.91,0:35:44.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克  你想谈什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you want to talk about, Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.14,0:35:47.80,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些东西不是病了  他们不是人\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things ain't sick. They're not people.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.80,0:35:50.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们死了  别心疼他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're dead. Ain't gonna feel nothing for them
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.28,0:35:52.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为他们只会杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause all they do, they kill!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.45,0:35:53.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}These things right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.77,0:35:55.72,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是杀死艾米的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're the things that killed amy.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.72,0:35:58.47,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们杀了奥蒂斯  他们会把我们杀光\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed Otis. They're gonna kill all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.47,0:35:59.77,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩  闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.21,0:36:02.43,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫谢尔  我问问你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Hershel man, let me ask you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.44,0:36:04.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个活生生的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could a living breathing person,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.02,0:36:05.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,面对这个能毫发无伤吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}could they walk away from this?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.38,0:36:06.56,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.11,0:36:10.96,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快住手  -胸口连中三枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop it! - That's three rounds in the chest.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.96,0:36:13.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个活生生的人  能承受得了这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could someone who's alive, could they just take that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:13.07,0:36:14.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它怎么还好好的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it still coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.53,0:36:17.32,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是它的心脏  它的肺\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's its heart, its lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.32,0:36:18.81,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它怎么还好好的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why is it still coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.10,0:36:22.98,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-肖恩  够了  -是啊  老兄你说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Shane, enough. - Yeah, you're right, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.98,0:36:24.27,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.45,0:36:44.38,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为了一个走丢的小女孩  我们已经冒够险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough risking our lives for a little girl who's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.78,0:36:48.33,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们受够住在这满是杀人怪物的谷仓旁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough living next to a barn full of things that are trying to kill us.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.33,0:36:52.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都够了  瑞克  今时不同往日\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough. Rick, it ain't like it was before!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.72,0:36:56.37,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你们还想活着  还想活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now if y'all want to live, if you want to survive,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.37,0:36:57.95,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必须为它战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to fight for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.95,0:37:01.39,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说就在这儿战斗  就在此刻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about fighting right here, right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.96,0:37:03.49,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓着套杆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take the snare pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.93,0:37:06.58,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫谢尔  帮我抓着这套杆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel, take the snare pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.58,0:37:09.10,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫谢尔  听我的  求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel, listen to me, man, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.10,0:37:11.59,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快抓着  赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it now. Hershel!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:11.60,0:37:12.70,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:17.16,0:37:21.02,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别  肖恩  别这样  兄弟  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, shane. Do not do this, brother. Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.17,0:37:26.13,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别这样  -瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't do it! - Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:26.13,0:37:27.36,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.78,0:37:33.01,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,出来吧  出来吧  我们就在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on, we're out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.01,0:37:34.54,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样解决不了问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.54,0:37:35.75,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.06,0:37:37.99,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,躲到我后边去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.11,0:37:39.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.60,0:38:06.45,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-玛姬  -去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Maggie. - It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.07,0:38:24.07,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.58,0:38:32.51,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.77,0:40:08.92,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,索菲亚  索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia? Sophia!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.64,0:40:12.23,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,索菲亚  索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia. Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.52,0:40:15.08,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh no. Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.26,0:40:27.83,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.35,0:40:29.87,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:51.52,0:40:53.05,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,索菲亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sophia.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.84,0:41:05.89,Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't watch.

